use anyhow :: { Context , Result } ; use std :: fs ; use std :: path :: { Path , PathBuf } ; use std :: process :: Command ; use std :: sync :: { Arc , Mutex } ; use std :: collections :: { HashMap , HashSet } ; use std :: io :: { BufRead , BufReader } ; use rayon :: prelude :: * ; use log :: { info , error , warn } ; use serde :: { Serialize , Deserialize } ; use regex ; use crate :: global_dep_graph :: { GlobalDependencyGraph , GlobalDependencyGraphBuilder } ; # [doc = " Find all Nix flake files in a directory"] pub fn find_all_flake_files (base_dir : & Path) -> Result < Vec < PathBuf > > { let mut flake_files = Vec :: new () ; if ! base_dir . exists () { return Ok (flake_files) ; } for entry in walkdir :: WalkDir :: new (base_dir) . follow_links (true) . sort_by_file_name () { let entry = entry ? ; if entry . file_name () == "flake.nix" { flake_files . push (entry . path () . to_path_buf ()) ; } } Ok (flake_files) }